<title>USA: Uniphase to sell wafer equipment unit.</title>
<headline>Uniphase to sell wafer equipment unit.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uniphase Corp Monday said it entered into a letter of intent with Tencor Instruments to sell Uniphase's Ultrapointe laser-based semiconductor wafer defect examination and analysis equipment business.</p>
<p>Terms of sale, which is scheduled to be completed prior to December 31, are undisclosed.</p>
